>              Trait2 ~~ 1*Trait2
>              Trait3 ~~ 1*Trait3
>              Trait4 ~~ 1*Trait4

There is the std.lv <http://std.lv> = TRUE option, but that will set the (residual)
variance of ALL latent variables to one, which is perhaps not what you want.

There is nothing wrong with syntax. It makes clear what you want.

Yves.

